# Owners — @nexora/domain-workspaces

## Code owners

- **Platform Engineering** (Tenancy squad) — @nexora/platform-eng
  - owns the Workspaces bounded context domain core
  - approves all aggregate, policy, and service changes

## Review requirements

- Changes to the `Workspace` aggregate or `WORKSPACE_TRANSITIONS` require an
  architecture reviewer sign-off (lifecycle is a cross-domain contract).
- New domain events must be added to the event catalog in sync with
  `packages/contracts`.
- Repository interfaces may only change with an infrastructure owner review.

## Areas

| Path            | Owner                             |
| --------------- | --------------------------------- |
| `src/entities/` | Platform Engineering (Tenancy)    |
| `src/policies/` | Platform Engineering + Architecture |
| `src/services/` | Platform Engineering              |
| `src/events/`   | Platform Engineering + Contracts  |
| `test/`         | Platform Engineering              |
